<title>GERMANY: Allianz names book value of stock, invest.</title>
<headline>Allianz names book value of stock, invest.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH, Germany 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>German insurance group Allianz AG Holding on Monday said the book value of its group stocks, investments and loans was 45.7 billion marks.</p>
<p>The figure was released by chairman Henning Schulte-Noelle at the group's annual shareholder meeting.</p>
<p>The parent company value was 23.35 billion marks.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
